  "id": "circle-of-security",
  "term": "Circle of Security",
  "definition": "Circle of Security, in this packet’s context, refers to Circle of Security-Parenting (COS-P), an attachment-based group programme for birthing parents in perinatal mental health services. It is described here as a 10-session intervention, often delivered online with babies present, aimed at supporting the parent-infant relationship.",
